{'symbol': 'NI', 'date': '2023-02-22 06:30:00', 'title': 'NISOURCE ANNOUNCES 2022 RESULTS, RAISES 2023 GUIDANCE', 'text': '2022 DILUTED NOEPS TOPS GUIDANCE RANGE; 2023 GUIDANCE RANGE INCREASED NIPSCO MINORITY INTEREST SALE LAUNCHED AND ON TRACK FOR 2023 MERRILLVILLE, IND. , FEB. 22, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NISOURCE (NYSE: NI) TODAY ANNOUNCED, ON A GAAP BASIS, 2022 NET INCOME AVAILABLE TO COMMON SHAREHOLDERS\xa0 WAS $749.0 MILLION, OR $1.70 DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE, COMPARED TO NET INCOME AVAILABLE TO COMMON SHAREHOLDERS OF $529.8 MILLION, OR $1.27 DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE, FOR THE SAME PERIOD OF 2021.'}